(i) Nominal diameter of the shaft;
(ii) Largest diameter of the shaft;
(iii) Smallest diameter of the hole;
(iv) The type of fit which will result from the assembly of the largest shaft and the smallest hole.

Name the metals produced from each of the furnaces listed below:
(i) Blast furnace;
(ii) Basic oxygen furnace;
(iii) Electric arc furnace.

Describe each of the following with regard to heat treatment:
(i) Quenching;
(ii) Work hardening.

In relation to plastic technology, describe any two of the following:
(i) Thermosetting plastic;
(ii) Elastic memory;
(iii) Thermoplastics.

